WEBVTT

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:22.845
Tell me
nanimo wakaranai no demo
Tell me
I don't understand anything, but

00:00:23.015 --> 00:00:30.015
You say
itsumo sonna kotoba mo
You always say those
kinds of words, too

00:00:30.965 --> 00:00:37.765
Surechigau dake no
You find another way
You find another way where
we only pass each other by

00:00:38.235 --> 00:00:44.865
Owatteku sekai wo tobidashite
You know?
And rush out into a world
that's ending, you know?

00:00:45.175 --> 00:00:50.735
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:00:51.015 --> 00:00:54.415
Hikari yori hayaku
Faster than light,

00:00:55.215 --> 00:00:59.245
monokuro no supiido de
with monochromic speed

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:05.055
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:01:05.295 --> 00:01:08.825
Jikan yori tooku
Farther than time,

00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:14.395
kakenukeru
You're so far away
I run through it;
you're so far away

00:01:30.415 --> 00:01:34.785
The End of the World

00:01:38.425 --> 00:01:41.455
My name is Morti.

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:44.465
Morti. You say?

00:01:49.605 --> 00:01:51.975
You're the one that took Rena?!

00:02:00.345 --> 00:02:01.745
W-what is this?

00:02:01.915 --> 00:02:02.915
I don't know!

00:02:02.915 --> 00:02:03.885
Be careful!

00:02:04.085 --> 00:02:05.245
It's coming!

00:02:06.755 --> 00:02:09.725
This is... my world.

00:02:40.925 --> 00:02:41.615
What's that?!

00:02:48.895 --> 00:02:49.925
This area...

00:02:50.335 --> 00:02:52.965
She can manipulate
"The World" as she wishes?

00:02:53.265 --> 00:02:55.095
Does she think she's a goddess?

00:02:58.545 --> 00:03:00.975
So all the mysterious
incidents that have been...

00:03:00.975 --> 00:03:02.875
...happening within
"The World" were...

00:03:06.845 --> 00:03:09.245
This time the Spring of Myst is empty!

00:03:15.595 --> 00:03:18.385
This is all her doing.

00:03:18.625 --> 00:03:20.595
Give back... Rena!

00:03:23.465 --> 00:03:26.495
Tres Bien! Bohemian!

00:03:26.565 --> 00:03:27.155
Komiyama!

00:03:31.405 --> 00:03:32.535
W-Why?!

00:03:33.605 --> 00:03:35.275
She can also teleport
player characters...

00:03:35.275 --> 00:03:36.805
...as she wishes!

00:03:44.955 --> 00:03:46.645
T-this is...

00:03:47.955 --> 00:03:49.785
The Capitol of Illusion, Nebel Mond...

00:03:50.325 --> 00:03:53.315
...is no longer under CC
Corporation's control?

00:03:54.495 --> 00:03:55.895
Whats going on?

00:03:59.005 --> 00:04:00.195
That was quick.

00:04:00.735 --> 00:04:02.395
Just who do you think I am?

00:04:04.205 --> 00:04:06.075
The leader of the Cerulean Knights.

00:04:06.905 --> 00:04:09.845
Oh, the former leader. Right, Kamui!

00:04:11.545 --> 00:04:13.515
I can't leave with things
the way they are.

00:04:20.225 --> 00:04:23.125
Here, here, don't you need items?

00:04:23.325 --> 00:04:23.795
Here here, don't you need items?

00:04:23.795 --> 00:04:25.125
Here here, don't you need items?
The non-player
characters... are moving.

00:04:25.125 --> 00:04:25.265
The non-player
characters... are moving.

00:04:25.265 --> 00:04:26.695
I have an extraordinary rare item.
The non-player
characters... are moving.

00:04:26.695 --> 00:04:27.855
I have an extraordinary rare item.

00:04:28.095 --> 00:04:29.855
Eh? Rare Item?

00:04:35.435 --> 00:04:36.095
Mireille!

00:04:40.205 --> 00:04:43.205
This certainly is... a lively reception.

00:04:50.555 --> 00:04:51.615
Sanjuro!

00:04:57.795 --> 00:04:59.485
W-Why?

00:04:59.695 --> 00:05:02.125
If we Data Drain her now...

00:05:02.895 --> 00:05:03.455
...Rena and...

00:05:04.235 --> 00:05:06.705
...the other missing
player characters...

00:05:12.745 --> 00:05:14.075
He seems to be in the
midst of confusion.

00:05:15.175 --> 00:05:18.445
Leave Balmung to do
his best for a while.

00:05:19.645 --> 00:05:22.615
Is it all right?
For me to be in this room.

00:05:23.255 --> 00:05:24.715
It seems that I was left in charge...

00:05:25.285 --> 00:05:26.255
...of this situation.

00:05:26.685 --> 00:05:28.985
Well, call it the power
of the one in charge.

00:05:29.895 --> 00:05:32.085
Don't blame me if the
higher ups hold a grudge.

00:05:32.895 --> 00:05:34.225
So, how was it?

00:05:34.735 --> 00:05:36.635
Inside the personal
computers of the kids?

00:05:38.035 --> 00:05:39.095
All kinds of things.

00:05:39.805 --> 00:05:41.135
All kinds, you say?

00:05:43.505 --> 00:05:44.335
They...

00:05:45.245 --> 00:05:47.175
...seem to hold an interest in "death".

00:05:49.475 --> 00:05:50.035
Death?

00:05:52.215 --> 00:05:54.375
That's right. Death.

00:06:12.135 --> 00:06:13.535
We did it!

00:06:15.335 --> 00:06:16.995
Do you need weapons?

00:06:17.475 --> 00:06:19.535
Do you need medicine?

00:06:19.775 --> 00:06:21.535
I have Gruntys too.

00:06:21.775 --> 00:06:22.645
Welcome!

00:06:23.615 --> 00:06:24.545
They've come back to life!

00:06:25.885 --> 00:06:26.475
That's right.

00:06:27.615 --> 00:06:29.145
They come back to life.

00:06:31.085 --> 00:06:32.455
It is difficult to die a...

00:06:33.185 --> 00:06:36.185
..."full death" within "The World".

00:06:37.155 --> 00:06:38.955
For non-player characters...

00:06:39.795 --> 00:06:41.665
...and for player characters.

00:06:42.195 --> 00:06:44.225
A "full death"?

00:06:44.535 --> 00:06:47.365
W- What are you talking about?

00:06:50.535 --> 00:06:52.205
There is a limit to jokes!

00:06:53.705 --> 00:06:54.405
In other words...

00:06:54.775 --> 00:06:57.975
Death within "The World" is...

00:06:58.515 --> 00:07:00.245
...like a joke.

00:07:02.115 --> 00:07:05.015
All you lose are experience
points and items.

00:07:06.625 --> 00:07:08.145
That's the source of their discontent.

00:07:11.965 --> 00:07:13.985
Do you need weapons?

00:07:14.025 --> 00:07:15.925
Do you need medicine?

00:07:16.135 --> 00:07:17.425
I have Gruntys too.

00:07:18.805 --> 00:07:23.265
I wish to know what true death is.

00:07:24.205 --> 00:07:26.235
That is all.

00:07:42.895 --> 00:07:43.825
I wish to know.

00:07:44.895 --> 00:07:46.295
That's all.

00:07:47.825 --> 00:07:49.455
And so, that wandering Al...

00:07:51.035 --> 00:07:52.765
...used the children...

00:07:53.505 --> 00:07:55.695
...to make the "full death" a reality...

00:07:57.705 --> 00:07:59.295
...within "The World"!

00:08:02.345 --> 00:08:04.405
Death within "The World"?

00:08:05.485 --> 00:08:07.535
Is that it?

00:08:13.855 --> 00:08:15.225
A modified monster!

00:08:19.025 --> 00:08:20.155
It's frozen.

00:08:21.695 --> 00:08:22.625
I finally managed to capture...

00:08:22.765 --> 00:08:24.565
...one without any damage.

00:08:25.635 --> 00:08:27.435
It has an interesting mechanism in it.

00:08:28.035 --> 00:08:28.735
Mechanism?

00:08:29.605 --> 00:08:30.865
When you're killed by it.

00:08:31.375 --> 00:08:31.935
That is...

00:08:32.005 --> 00:08:33.495
...when your hit points reach zero...

00:08:33.875 --> 00:08:35.505
...a special gate opens.

00:08:36.515 --> 00:08:37.675
It teleports you to an...

00:08:37.975 --> 00:08:39.675
...area within another server.

00:08:41.045 --> 00:08:42.845
That private server?!

00:08:43.885 --> 00:08:44.615
At that time...

00:08:45.225 --> 00:08:46.055
...the player is...

00:08:46.355 --> 00:08:47.985
...placed under a powerful suggestion.

00:08:53.865 --> 00:09:00.795
I'm dead. I'm dead. I'm dead.

00:09:02.475 --> 00:09:06.135
A suggestion that they are really dead!

00:09:09.115 --> 00:09:13.545
I wondered why they
made such a program.

00:09:14.585 --> 00:09:16.815
But if a "full death" is their goal then...

00:09:16.815 --> 00:09:17.915
...I can understand it.

00:09:19.285 --> 00:09:19.845
But...

00:09:20.525 --> 00:09:23.385
In order to complete this plan...

00:09:24.095 --> 00:09:25.995
...there would be a huge obstacle.

00:09:27.925 --> 00:09:29.825
CC Corporation's real headache.

00:09:31.365 --> 00:09:33.165
The notion of "full death" contradicts...

00:09:33.805 --> 00:09:36.205
...the basic idea of "The World".

00:09:36.875 --> 00:09:37.705
"The World"...

00:09:37.935 --> 00:09:39.375
...would go down a
path of destruction.

00:09:41.405 --> 00:09:43.245
Death to player characters.

00:09:44.175 --> 00:09:47.305
A "full death" to this world.

00:09:48.085 --> 00:09:50.345
If "The World" might be destroyed...

00:09:51.015 --> 00:09:53.575
...the omnipresent will of
this world would go to work.

00:09:54.255 --> 00:09:56.085
Omnipresent... will?

00:09:57.755 --> 00:09:58.525
Aura.

00:10:02.765 --> 00:10:05.025
The girl that gave me the bracelet!

00:10:07.235 --> 00:10:09.565
Soon after she started her plans...

00:10:10.335 --> 00:10:12.105
...Aura began to make her move.

00:10:13.245 --> 00:10:13.965
Namely...

00:10:14.875 --> 00:10:17.205
...the revival of the dot Hackers!

00:10:43.235 --> 00:10:46.135
She gave you Kite's Bracelet.

00:10:50.615 --> 00:10:52.405
Because the power of the...

00:10:52.685 --> 00:10:55.275
...bracelet could be
used to stop this plan.

00:11:03.295 --> 00:11:05.315
That's why she tried to kill Shugo...

00:11:05.765 --> 00:11:08.625
...and kept sending all
those modified monsters!

00:11:09.295 --> 00:11:11.995
Then Rena was Shugo's substitute?

00:11:13.405 --> 00:11:14.025
No.

00:11:15.235 --> 00:11:17.605
It might not have
been accidental at all.

00:11:19.845 --> 00:11:20.675
That's true.

00:11:22.075 --> 00:11:24.045
I searched the children's computers.

00:11:24.775 --> 00:11:27.745
There was data pointing
to Shugo as the target.

00:11:28.915 --> 00:11:29.505
But...

00:11:31.415 --> 00:11:32.575
Did something bother you?

00:11:33.425 --> 00:11:35.115
The more I analyzed it...

00:11:35.825 --> 00:11:36.515
...the more I began...

00:11:36.725 --> 00:11:39.195
...to think that Rena
was the real target.

00:11:41.595 --> 00:11:42.565
Think about it.

00:11:43.435 --> 00:11:44.865
If this thing killed Shugo...

00:11:45.265 --> 00:11:48.035
...it would teleport
him to that area right?

00:11:49.105 --> 00:11:50.795
And if the suggestion
wasn't complete...

00:11:51.235 --> 00:11:53.135
...and Shugo happened to awaken?

00:11:54.805 --> 00:11:56.315
There would be nothing capable...

00:11:56.315 --> 00:11:58.045
...of opposing the bracelet's power.

00:11:59.545 --> 00:12:00.945
He would see through the plan and...

00:12:01.345 --> 00:12:03.285
...the chances of its
failure would be high.

00:12:05.985 --> 00:12:06.685
In fact...

00:12:06.985 --> 00:12:08.615
...the suggestion on
Rena was removed.

00:12:11.895 --> 00:12:12.825
I...

00:12:13.525 --> 00:12:16.155
...wish to know what true death is.

00:12:16.995 --> 00:12:18.295
That is all.

00:12:19.435 --> 00:12:21.995
The risk of targeting
Shugo was too high...

00:12:22.205 --> 00:12:25.195
...so she changed the target to Rena.

00:12:25.645 --> 00:12:27.875
B-but why Rena?!

00:12:28.005 --> 00:12:29.115
It's because of the...

00:12:29.115 --> 00:12:31.235
...incredible item that
you have, Shugo.

00:12:32.615 --> 00:12:34.775
To destroy Aura's existence.

00:12:37.955 --> 00:12:38.945
Aura?

00:12:40.125 --> 00:12:42.955
That is all.

00:12:52.735 --> 00:12:53.595
That child?

00:13:09.855 --> 00:13:10.575
Aura.

00:13:12.055 --> 00:13:14.145
She is the omnipresent
will of "The World".

00:13:15.855 --> 00:13:18.795
That means she is everywhere...

00:13:19.465 --> 00:13:22.725
...and yet she is nowhere.

00:13:24.665 --> 00:13:27.325
It's hard to erase something
that doesn't exist.

00:13:31.475 --> 00:13:34.375
But that doesn't mean
that there isn't a way.

00:13:35.745 --> 00:13:38.375
One of those methods was Rena?

00:13:53.125 --> 00:13:54.925
Shugo!

00:14:02.175 --> 00:14:03.695
How will she make her move?!

00:14:04.535 --> 00:14:05.335
I don't know.

00:14:06.005 --> 00:14:08.905
The only certainty is
that she doesn't like us.

00:14:09.815 --> 00:14:10.535
Aura is...

00:14:13.245 --> 00:14:14.805
Aura is unnecessary.

00:14:19.855 --> 00:14:22.615
She will be completely erased.

00:14:24.055 --> 00:14:27.585
First, we must develop a
highly contagious virus.

00:14:28.635 --> 00:14:31.155
Something capable of deleting
all the corrupted data.

00:14:31.905 --> 00:14:33.925
A kind of Apoptosis Virus.

00:14:34.965 --> 00:14:36.195
A complete deletion would be...

00:14:36.805 --> 00:14:37.965
Difficult.

00:14:38.705 --> 00:14:40.695
Especially within "The World".

00:14:41.245 --> 00:14:42.865
There are backup systems.

00:14:43.845 --> 00:14:46.215
But it can be developed.

00:14:48.045 --> 00:14:51.045
If that virus is delivered by Rena.

00:14:59.195 --> 00:15:00.215
Shugo.

00:15:01.795 --> 00:15:02.785
Shugo!

00:15:03.195 --> 00:15:03.785
Rena!

00:15:07.065 --> 00:15:10.165
To realize the "World of the Dead".

00:15:16.875 --> 00:15:19.745
N-No!!

00:15:22.285 --> 00:15:22.805
Rena!

00:15:38.735 --> 00:15:40.565
It's tracing Rena's member address...

00:15:40.835 --> 00:15:43.095
...to everyone that's connected to her.

00:15:47.505 --> 00:15:50.275
Our hit points are diminishing!

00:15:50.815 --> 00:15:51.715
Using the virus.

00:15:52.315 --> 00:15:53.215
She's trying...

00:15:53.785 --> 00:15:56.685
...to delete everyone
connected to Rena!

00:15:57.255 --> 00:15:58.155
Everyone?

00:15:59.185 --> 00:16:01.655
Naturally, Aura as well.

00:16:34.825 --> 00:16:35.945
Rena!

00:16:42.465 --> 00:16:45.155
No!

00:16:46.905 --> 00:16:47.865
R-Rena!

00:16:49.505 --> 00:16:51.975
It's no good. I can't logout.

00:16:52.305 --> 00:16:53.275
At this rate...

00:16:58.215 --> 00:17:00.335
No!

00:17:03.015 --> 00:17:04.045
Aura!

00:17:08.355 --> 00:17:11.915
A... u... ra.

00:17:14.295 --> 00:17:16.495
N-now while you can.

00:17:17.195 --> 00:17:18.095
Hurry.

00:17:18.665 --> 00:17:20.195
If you can defeat the monster.

00:17:20.635 --> 00:17:21.465
The virus...

00:17:21.905 --> 00:17:22.525
Understood!

00:17:23.575 --> 00:17:24.465
Phal Repth!

00:17:30.045 --> 00:17:31.015
My hit points!

00:17:35.315 --> 00:17:36.975
It's not here.

00:17:38.785 --> 00:17:40.045
There's nothing here.

00:17:45.995 --> 00:17:47.465
Hyper Vak!

00:17:50.795 --> 00:17:51.495
Ohka!

00:17:52.405 --> 00:17:53.525
Ohka! Your clothes!

00:17:53.635 --> 00:17:55.565
What? Mireille, yours too!

00:17:56.105 --> 00:17:56.695
Eh?

00:17:57.805 --> 00:17:59.435
W-What is this?!

00:18:03.845 --> 00:18:05.275
It's the effect of the virus!

00:18:07.115 --> 00:18:08.415
If we don't destroy it quickly...

00:18:09.255 --> 00:18:10.515
I finally found Rena!

00:18:11.955 --> 00:18:13.945
I'll save her for sure!

00:18:14.685 --> 00:18:18.485
Shu... Shugo!

00:18:19.725 --> 00:18:22.165
Give her back!

00:18:27.335 --> 00:18:29.235
Re... Rena!

00:18:29.305 --> 00:18:30.665
Shugo!

00:18:32.505 --> 00:18:32.995
It's no good!

00:18:33.645 --> 00:18:35.905
We can't make a vaccine for this virus!

00:18:36.715 --> 00:18:38.415
We have no choice but to destroy...

00:18:38.415 --> 00:18:39.775
...the source of transmission.

00:18:40.945 --> 00:18:42.175
Do you think that can be done?

00:18:43.015 --> 00:18:43.915
If we can't...

00:18:45.185 --> 00:18:46.415
...the existence within "The World"...

00:18:46.525 --> 00:18:48.715
...known as Aura will cease to be.

00:18:49.195 --> 00:18:49.885
And then...

00:18:50.795 --> 00:18:53.425
..."The Terror of Death"
will overtake "The World".

00:18:56.765 --> 00:18:57.625
Before that...

00:18:58.265 --> 00:18:59.735
...I wonder what will happen to us?

00:19:00.235 --> 00:19:01.135
I don't know.

00:19:02.035 --> 00:19:03.165
Either we'll be sent to the...

00:19:03.305 --> 00:19:06.965
...hospital in a coma
like the others or...

00:19:07.845 --> 00:19:10.575
...the first to die in this incident.

00:19:12.085 --> 00:19:14.245
I can't do anything if I stay here.

00:19:16.155 --> 00:19:16.775
In the end...

00:19:17.085 --> 00:19:19.485
...you go to be by the one you love?

00:19:21.425 --> 00:19:22.685
I know.

00:19:23.295 --> 00:19:26.225
I'm also a big fan of Balmung's.

00:19:27.125 --> 00:19:28.685
He's a little hard-headed but...

00:19:29.065 --> 00:19:30.495
...just as I thought...

00:19:30.795 --> 00:19:32.195
..."The World" can't do without him.

00:19:32.565 --> 00:19:33.395
That is...

00:19:33.935 --> 00:19:35.425
...the reasoning behind your actions?

00:19:36.805 --> 00:19:37.895
How simple.

00:19:39.005 --> 00:19:40.165
Isn't it enviable?

00:19:55.825 --> 00:19:56.655
Shugo!

00:19:59.695 --> 00:20:00.165
What!

00:20:02.335 --> 00:20:05.355
My staff! I can't use my spells!

00:20:07.035 --> 00:20:09.165
Finally, we're left empty-handed?

00:20:12.875 --> 00:20:15.905
Not yet! I have this!

00:20:16.675 --> 00:20:18.305
It wasn't affected by the virus?!

00:20:18.745 --> 00:20:20.215
Because it's a special item.

00:20:20.845 --> 00:20:22.555
Here I go! Data-

00:20:22.555 --> 00:20:22.685
No!
Here I go! Data-

00:20:22.685 --> 00:20:23.305
No!

00:20:25.725 --> 00:20:26.745
Rena...

00:20:27.185 --> 00:20:28.585
...would also be data drained.

00:20:31.995 --> 00:20:33.115
If that happens...

00:20:33.625 --> 00:20:37.295
...I will not be able to stop
the progress of the virus.

00:20:37.995 --> 00:20:38.965
Then I can't...

00:20:39.605 --> 00:20:41.095
...save Rena with the bracelet.

00:20:47.375 --> 00:20:48.365
Shugo!

00:20:48.915 --> 00:20:49.895
Shugo!

00:20:50.175 --> 00:20:51.775
Shugo!

00:20:53.785 --> 00:20:55.115
Dark Traitor!

00:20:59.555 --> 00:21:00.115
Kamui!

00:21:00.855 --> 00:21:02.415
We may not be able
to use equipment...

00:21:02.895 --> 00:21:04.795
...but we should still
be able to use items!

00:21:06.225 --> 00:21:08.055
This is a knight's battle of revenge!

00:21:16.735 --> 00:21:19.175
I'm coming for you, Rena!

00:21:37.925 --> 00:21:38.785
You're...

00:21:46.165 --> 00:21:47.135
Shugo.

00:21:50.075 --> 00:21:50.605
Preview

00:21:50.605 --> 00:21:52.505
Preview
I have the final information!

00:21:52.505 --> 00:21:52.675
Preview

00:21:52.675 --> 00:21:53.605
Preview
This is terrible! Terrible!

00:21:53.605 --> 00:21:53.745
Preview

00:21:53.745 --> 00:21:55.615
Preview
"The World" might go away.

00:21:55.615 --> 00:21:55.775
Preview

00:21:55.775 --> 00:21:57.275
Preview
I don't want it to!

00:21:57.275 --> 00:21:57.535
I don't want it to!

00:21:58.245 --> 00:22:01.775
Because I want to always
be with you, Shugo!

00:22:02.185 --> 00:22:05.055
The Legend Begins

00:22:06.625 --> 00:22:17.055
Hashitteyuku kodomotachi
no hashagu warai koe ni
In the running children's
frolicking voices

00:22:17.465 --> 00:22:24.965
Hikari to kage oikakete mitaku naru
They want to chase
the light and shadows

00:22:28.275 --> 00:22:38.705
Midori no ha ni sukashite
mita ano taiyou no saki ni
Watching the sun shine
between the green leaves,

00:22:39.025 --> 00:22:47.795
Nani ga aru to omotteita no darou
wondering if something is there.

00:22:49.135 --> 00:22:59.375
Emerald Green hana wo
tsunda te no naka kara
From inside the hands picking,
the emerald green flowers

00:22:59.775 --> 00:23:10.275
Sora kaze tsuchi e to
sugata wo kaeteyuku
change their body to the
sky, the wind, the ground.

00:23:10.585 --> 00:23:22.485
Sono utsukushisa ni me wo
hiraita mabushi sugiru basho de
Laying in that opulent place that
opened its eyes to that beauty,

00:23:22.835 --> 00:23:30.435
Nekoronda sora ni toikaketeru
Asking questions to the sky
